// ── Markdown renderer ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Converts AI reply_text (markdown) into safe HTML.
// Handles: numbered lists, [text](url) links, **bold**, plain paragraphs.
// NOTE: all regex backslashes are double-escaped (\\) because this code
